---
permalink: /agents/index.html
title: "Agents running in production | Sora Labs"
description: "Six purpose-built AI agents generated so far: Logan, Pearl, Nadia, Tony, George and Frank. Each shows the job it does, what it runs on, and the work it hands a human."
nav_active: agents
---
{% extends "layouts/site.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<section class="hero center" style="padding-bottom:44px;">
  <div class="orb-field" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="orb orb-sky"   style="width:480px;height:480px;top:-170px;left:10%"></span>
    <span class="orb orb-rose"  style="width:420px;height:420px;top:-140px;right:10%"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">The roster</div>
    <h1>Agents running in production</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Six generated so far, one job each. Beside every one is the thing it actually hands a human, which is the only test that matters.</p>
    <div class="btn-row center">
      <a href="/build/" class="btn-primary">Generate an agent&nbsp;&rarr;</a>
      <a href="/how-it-works/" class="btn-outline">How one gets generated</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="section-tight section-hairline" style="padding:26px 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="jump-nav">
      {%- for a in agents %}
      <a class="jump" href="#{{ a.id }}">{{ a.name }}</a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% for a in agents %}
<section class="agent-row" id="{{ a.id }}">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split-start">

      <div class="agent-col">
        <div class="agent-mark agent-mark-lg" style="background:var(--orb-{{ a.accent }})">{{ a.mark | safe }}</div>
        <h2>{{ a.name }}</h2>
        <div class="agent-role">{{ a.role }}</div>
        <p class="agent-claim">{{ a.headline }}</p>

        <div class="before-after">
          <div class="ba-col ba-before">
            <div class="ba-label">Before</div>
            <p>{{ a.before }}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ba-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="10" viewBox="0 0 20 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M0 5h18M14 1l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="ba-col ba-after">
            <div class="ba-label">After</div>
            <p>{{ a.after }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="runs-on"><span>Runs on</span> {% for c in a.connectors %}{{ c }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>

        <details class="brief-quiet">
          <summary>How {{ a.name }} works, and the spec behind it</summary>
          <div class="brief-quiet-body">
            <p class="narrative">{{ a.long }}</p>
            <div class="meta-label">Automates</div>
            <ul class="agent-does">
              {%- for item in a.automates %}
              <li>{{ item }}</li>
              {%- endfor %}
            </ul>
            <div class="meta-label" style="margin-top:22px;">The spec</div>
            <div class="ui-kv"><div class="ui-k">Name</div><div class="ui-v">{{ a.name }}</div></div>
            <div class="ui-kv"><div class="ui-k">Role</div><div class="ui-v">{{ a.role }}</div></div>
            {%- for key, value in a.brief %}
            <div class="ui-kv"><div class="ui-k">{{ key }}</div><div class="ui-v">{{ value }}</div></div>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="ui">
          <div class="ui-bar">
            <span class="ui-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="ui-title">{{ a.outputLabel }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ui-body">{{ a.output | safe }}</div>
          <div class="ui-foot"><span>{{ a.outputFoot.left }}</span><span class="approve">{{ a.outputFoot.right }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="caption" style="margin-top:12px;">What {{ a.name }} hands a human. Real in shape, changed in detail.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="section section-hairline">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">Disclosure</div>
      <h2>Nadia and Logan are agents, not people</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Both run inside Sora Labs as well as for customers, and both are AI. We say so wherever their work shows up, including the newsletter Nadia drafts. A human reviews everything before it reaches you.</p>
      <p>Pearl was generated for a dental practice that prefers to stay unnamed, so the numbers and payer specifics stay theirs. Every output above is real in shape, changed in detail. The pattern is what transfers: one desk, one job, one clear line where a person takes over.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="orb-field" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="orb orb-mint" style="width:500px;height:500px;top:-60px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Generate the seventh</h2>
    <p>Name it, describe the job in a few sentences, and list what it needs to reach. The spec comes back within one business day.</p>
    <div class="btn-row center">
      <a href="/build/" class="btn-primary">Generate an agent&nbsp;&rarr;</a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-outline">Talk it through first</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
